# Test vectors of teseladb-tls (013 T008), stored in crates/teseladb-tls/tests/data/ and checked by
# tests/integrity.rs against this list. Written on 2026-10-30.
# rfc8448.tsv: every value with a length of the traces of sections 3 to 7 of
#   https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8448.txt (SHA-256 6564d1376d1ec744fc7a9993da15ebc1b9be361908b166091f47ef605c537fba),
#   one per line as section, side, step, label and hex, in the RFC's order.
# cavp/tls.rsp: the TLS key derivation vectors of NIST SP 800-135 (CAVP, public domain), tls.rsp of
#   https://csrc.nist.gov/CSRC/media/Projects/Cryptographic-Algorithm-Validation-Program/documents/components/800-135testvectors/tls.zip
#   (SHA-256 5944b3affa6bfccd1fc4b2876ab273526910447aa754effae0db9fe7c8412793), unchanged; downloaded on 2026-10-31.
